	(text "USB sheet notes\n- MagSafe puck: a USB-C receptacle at the bottom edge takes a short C-to-C cable to the\n  phone (the phone is host and 5 V source). Rd = 5.1k on both CC1 and CC2.\n  (The Altium drawing used a UP20 plug for the direct-plug dongle concept.)\n- USB 2.0 full-speed device; D+/D- run straight to the nRF52840 (internal series R).\n- Keep total VBUS capacitance <= 10 uF (USB 2.0 inrush)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "e4ff53ad-1a57-5561-8dec-1ef5f5b3f836"))
